  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Float Along – Fill Your Lungs** (1 review): Reviewer calls the final song great advice for everyone [5]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Blame It On The Weather**: rare: 12 archived performances [8]\n- **Presumptuous**: rare: 9 archived performances [8]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Hypertension [8]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2022-10-23.vwmule** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 110 min; rated 5/5 by 6 [1]. Said about its sound: User found the full recording on the Archive, unlike their own shoddy phone clips [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The reviewer attended the concert live and missed some full renditions with their phone [2]\n- Reviewer's first live experience with the band, praising the energy and venue staff [4]\n- First-time attendee wanted to create bootlegs to commemorate the experience with a friend [7]\n- Show was postponed twice due to Covid-19, originally scheduled for May 2020 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2022-10-23.vwmule**: taped by Alex Leary; transferred by Alex Leary; source: DPA 4023 > Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [1]\n- kglw2022-10-23.vwmule: Reviewer addresses Alex Leary, thanking him for the top-notch recording quality [1][5]\n- kglw2022-10-23.vwmule: Recorded with DPA 4023 mics into a Sound Devices MixPre-6 at 24/48 [1]\n- kglw2022-10-23.vwmule: Transferred from MP6 to iMac, tracked in Sound Studio, and encoded via xACT [1]",
